  "start#about-the-conformance-project": "<h1 id=\"about-the-conformance-project\">About the conformance project</h1>\n<p>This README compiles as the orientation document, slug <code>start</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"how\">How it works</h2>\n<p>Documents carry their open questions beside the passage that raised them.</p>",
  "start#how": "<h2 id=\"how\">How it works</h2>\n<p>Documents carry their open questions beside the passage that raised them.</p>",
  "activity/2026-09-14-started#started": "<h2 id=\"started\">Started</h2>\n<p>The conformance project started.</p>",
  "decisions/2026-09-17-monthly#monthly": "<h2 id=\"monthly\">Publish monthly</h2>\n<p><strong>Decision.</strong> The project publishes once a month.</p>",
  "guide#the-guide": "<h1 id=\"the-guide\">The guide</h1>\n<p>An ordinary document.</p>\n<h2 id=\"scope\">Scope</h2>\n<p>What the project covers, and what it leaves out.</p>\n<aside class=\"q q-open\" id=\"q1\" data-question=\"conformance:what-scope\" data-number=\"1\" data-audience=\"public\"><header class=\"q-head\"><a class=\"q-num\" href=\"/questions/#q1\">Q1</a> <span class=\"q-audience\">public</span></header><div class=\"q-body\"><p>Is the scope right for a first version?</p></div><div class=\"q-why\"><strong>Why asked:</strong>everything else depends on it.</div><p class=\"q-see\">Context: <a href=\"/guide/#method\" data-see-section=\"guide#method\">Method</a> · <a href=\"https://example.org/spec\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">the external spec ↗</a></p><div class=\"q-answers\" data-answers-for=\"conformance:what-scope\"></div></aside><h2 id=\"method\">Method</h2>\n<p>How the work is done. As one reviewer put it, <i data-answer=\"what-scope\">keep it small</i>.</p>\n<aside class=\"q q-open\" id=\"q4\" data-question=\"conformance:members-only\" data-number=\"4\" data-audience=\"members\"><header class=\"q-head\"><a class=\"q-num\" href=\"/questions/#q4\">Q4</a> <span class=\"q-audience\">members</span></header><div class=\"q-body\"><p>MEMBERS-ONLY-SENTINEL: which internal tool do we use for the count?</p></div><div class=\"q-why\"><strong>Why asked:</strong>this text must never reach a non-member.</div><div class=\"q-answers\" data-answers-for=\"conformance:members-only\"></div></aside><h2 id=\"settled\">Settled</h2>\n<p>The project publishes monthly.</p>\n<aside class=\"q q-resolved\" id=\"q3\" data-question=\"conformance:cadence\" data-number=\"3\" data-audience=\"public\"><header class=\"q-head\"><a class=\"q-num\" href=\"/questions/#q3\">Q3</a> <span class=\"q-audience\">public</span></header><div class=\"q-body\"><p>How often should the project publish?</p></div><p class=\"q-resolved-note\">resolved · see <a href=\"#settled\">this passage</a></p><div class=\"q-answers\" data-answers-for=\"conformance:cadence\"></div></aside><aside class=\"q q-open\" id=\"q6\" data-question=\"conformance:withdrawn\" data-number=\"6\" data-audience=\"members\"><header class=\"q-head\"><a class=\"q-num\" href=\"/questions/#q6\">Q6</a> <span class=\"q-audience\">members</span></header><div class=\"q-body\"><p>A question that was hidden rather than retired.</p></div><div class=\"q-answers\" data-answers-for=\"conformance:withdrawn\"></div></aside>",
